@startuml
|APAF System|
start
:Request ASPERA-3 experiment telemetry\nand MEX Orbit/Attitude telemetry from ESOC;

|ESOC|
:Provide requested telemetry data;

|APAF System|
:Receive telemetry data;
if (Acquisition error?) then (yes)
  :Built-in error handling\n(log / alert / recover);
  stop
else (no)
endif

:Determine whether ESOC provided cleaned-up telemetry;
if (Cleaned-up telemetry provided by ESOC?) then (yes)
  :Use ESOC cleaned-up telemetry;
else (no)
  :Generate intermediate cleaned-up telemetry files;
  if (Cleanup generation error?) then (yes)
    :Built-in error handling\n(log / alert / recover);
    stop
  else (no)
  endif

  :Store intermediate cleaned-up telemetry files\non local SwRI archive;
  |SwRI Archive|
  :Archive intermediate cleaned-up telemetry files;
  |APAF System|
  if (Archive error?) then (yes)
    :Built-in error handling\n(log / alert / recover);
    stop
  else (no)
  endif
endif

:Store ASPERA-3 and MEX OA telemetry data\non local SwRI archive;
|SwRI Archive|
:Archive telemetry data;
|APAF System|
if (Archive error?) then (yes)
  :Built-in error handling\n(log / alert / recover);
  stop
else (no)
endif

fork
  :Process ASPERA-3 science data\ninto IDFS data sets;
fork again
  :Process engineering and ancillary information\nfor calibration and science validation\ninto IDFS data sets;
end fork

if (IDFS processing error?) then (yes)
  :Built-in error handling\n(log / alert / recover);
  stop
else (no)
endif

:Store ASPERA-3 and MEX OA IDFS data sets\non local SwRI archive;
|SwRI Archive|
:Archive IDFS data sets;
|APAF System|
if (Archive error?) then (yes)
  :Built-in error handling\n(log / alert / recover);
  stop
else (no)
endif

fork
  :Provide web-based displays of the most current\nASPERA-3 data for public view;
  |Public Viewer|
  :View most current ASPERA-3 displays;
fork again
  |ASPERA-3 Team|
  :Define web-based displays for science analysis;

  |APAF System|
  :Provide team-defined web-based science analysis displays\nusing any available ASPERA-3 data;

  if (ASPERA-3 data made public?) then (yes)
    |Science Analyst|
    :Access science analysis displays (no password protection);
  else (no)
    |Science Analyst|
    :Enter credentials to access science analysis displays;
    |APAF System|
    if (Credentials valid?) then (yes)
      |Science Analyst|
      :Use science analysis displays;
    else (no)
      :Deny access and log attempt;
    endif
  endif
end fork

stop
@enduml